const updateLatestContract=(fn,label=null,extra=null)=>{saveEvents(getEvents().map(e=>{if(e.id!==state.selectedId)return e;const cs=[...(e.contratos||[])];if(!cs.length)return e;const i=cs.length-1;cs[i]={...cs[i],assinatura:fn({...(cs[i].assinatura||{})})};const next={...e,contratos:cs,historico:label?[...(e.historico||[]),history(label,cs[i].codigo||`V${cs[i].versao}`)]:(e.historico||[])};return extra?{...next,...extra(next)}:next;}));};
